── UNKNOWN NAME ────────────────────────────────── E0211_c_void.lt:1:15  [E0211]

Stilt has no `void`: a function that gives no value has the result type `()`:

  1 │ fn greet() -> void {}
    │               ^^^^

A function whose result type isn't written gives `()`, the empty tuple.

To fix it, write `()`:

  1 │ fn greet() -> () {}
    │               ~~
